Usage: winter [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  Winter — workspace management CLI.

Options:
  --version                       Show the version and exit.
  --service-orchestrator PATH_OR_NAME
                                  Override the service orchestrator for this
                                  invocation. A local path (contains a path
                                  separator or resolves to an existing
                                  directory) short-circuits the registered-
                                  extension lookup and reads that directory's
                                  winter-ext.toml directly. A bare name falls
                                  back to the registered-extension lookup.
                                  Takes precedence over
                                  WINTER_SERVICE_ORCHESTRATOR and
                                  capabilities.service in .winter/config.toml.
  -v, --verbose                   Enable DEBUG-level logging on stderr.
                                  Equivalent to WINTER_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG.
                                  Diagnostics always go to stderr; --json
                                  stdout stays pure JSON.
  --help                          Show this message and exit.

